<Typography as="article">
  <h2>Deploying a release</h2>
  <p>
    Every push to <code>main</code> builds a preview. Promote it to production when the checks pass.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Builds take about two minutes.</li>
    <li>Previews stay up for thirty days.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Read the <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/deploy/">deploy guide</a> for the details.
  </p>
</Typography>
